[7.689, "o", "\r\nQ: What is the maximum payload of a K-4 Kestrel in rain?\r\nA: 1.8 kg [1]\r\n   sources: [1] kestrel_operations_handbook#p1t0r1 (0.726); [2] kestrel_operations_handbook#p1t0r2 (0.68); [3] kestrel_operations_handbook#p1t0r0 (0.679); [4] kestrel_"]
[9.689, "o", "operations_handbook#0 (0.591)\r\n\r\nQ: A Standard delivery arrived 41 minutes late. What does the customer get?\r\nA: A refund of 50% of the delivery fee, issued automatically within 5 business days. [1]\r\n   sources: [1] kestrel_customer_service_policy#0 (0.528); [2] kestrel_customer_service_policy#1 (0.339); [3] kestrel_incident_review_q3_2026#0 (0.338); [4] kestrel_opera"]
[11.427, "o", "tions_handbook#p1t1r1 (0.306)\r\n\r\nQ: Which latch firmware version fixed the early-release bug?\r\nA: Latch firmware version 3.1.6 fixed the early-release bug [3].\r\n   sources: [1] kestrel_incident_review_q3_2026#p1t0r1 (0.492); [2] kestrel_incident_review_q3_2026#1 (0.433); [3] kestrel_incident_review_q3_2026#0 (0.307); [4] kestrel_incident_"]
[12.402, "o", "review_q3_2026#p1t0r0 (0.233)\r\n\r\nQ: Who is the CEO of Kestrel?\r\nA: Not in the documents.\r\n   sources: [1] kestrel_incident_review_q3_2026#2 (0.443); [2] kestrel_customer_service_policy#0 (0.389); [3] kestrel_operations_handbook#0 (0.383); [4] kestrel_incident"]
[12.402, "o", "_review_q3_2026#p1t0r1 (0.38)\r\n"]
